{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07328","headline":"杪秋洞庭中怀亡道士谢太虚 · 刘长卿","name":"杪秋洞庭中怀亡道士谢太虚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漂泊日复日，洞庭今更秋。\n青枫亦何意，此夜催人愁。\n惆怅客中月，徘徊江上楼。\n心知楚天远，目送沧波流。\n羽客久已殁，微言无处求。\n空余白云在，容与随孤舟。\n千里杳难望，一身当独游。\n故园复何许，江海徒迟留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}